source: crates/leptoskit_cli/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: "normalize(&stdout(&output), &scratch.path)"
---
Checks the local environment for missing tooling: the tools every build uses, then each native platform the project targets; exits non-zero when a required check fails

Usage: leptoskit doctor [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --all                Checks every native platform this machine can build, not just the project's
      --app-target <NAME>  Select a named target from the root leptoskit.toml
  -h, --help               Print help
  -V, --version            Print version
